Yes - The installation of the can=5Fif into /etc/init.d was missing.

By adding:

do=5Finstall () {
        install -d ${D}${sysconfdir}/init.d
        cat ${WORKDIR}/can=5Fif | \
          sed -e 's,/etc,${sysconfdir},g' \
              -e 's,/usr/sbin,${sbindir},g' \
              -e 's,/var,${localstatedir},g' \
              -e 's,/usr/bin,${bindir},g' \
              -e 's,/usr,${prefix},g' > ${D}${sysconfdir}/init.d/can=5Fif
        chmod a+x ${D}${sysconfdir}/init.d/can=5Fif
}

It was solved!

Merci & Regards!

